  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Ishita Jairath\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Ishita Jairath</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Sep 29, 2026 at 07:35 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/new+delhi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">New Delhi</a>: Patients requiring critical care and treatment for infectious diseases may soon get additional facilities at <a href=\"/tag/aiims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AIIMS</a>, with <a href=\"/tag/delhi+urban+art+commission+%28duac%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Delhi Urban Art Commission (DUAC)</a> approving the building plan for a new critical care and <a href=\"/tag/infectious+diseases+block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">infectious diseases block</a> along with a <a href=\"/tag/multi-level+car+parking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">multi-level car parking</a> facility.The approval was granted after DUAC examined a revised proposal submitted by <a href=\"/tag/central+public+works+department+%28cpwd%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Central Public Works Department (CPWD)</a> through Online Proposal Assessment and Approval System (OPAAS). The commission had earlier withheld approval in Sept 2024 and sought modifications to the design and planning of the project.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The revised submission included updated drawings, photographs and responses to the commission’s observations. DUAC subsequently cleared the proposal, subject to compliance with conditions relating to design, parking, utility screening and sustainability.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The commission directed that all parking provisions conform to applicable norms and guidelines. It also asked project authorities to ensure that service equipment, diesel generator sets, exhaust pipes, water tanks, air-conditioning units, <a href=\"/tag/solar+panels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">solar panels</a>, plumbing and rainwater pipes are adequately screened or camouflaged.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>DUAC said the project should maintain <a href=\"/tag/urban+aesthetics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">urban aesthetics</a> and architectural character while remaining compatible with the surrounding built environment. It also reviewed the proposed façade treatment, materials and overall built form.As part of the approval, the commission mandated installation of a public artwork of appropriate scale within the complex. Any change to the approved artwork design will require prior clearance from DUAC.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The commission also suggested the use of solar panels on a suitably designed structural frame, subject to building bye-laws. According to DUAC, such a design could improve space utilisation, facilitate maintenance, provide shading and help reduce heat load.The project forms part of AIIMS’ broader infrastructure expansion plans. AIIMS documents have listed the proposed critical care and infectious diseases block at the <a href=\"/tag/jpn+apex+trauma+centre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JPN Apex Trauma Centre</a> among projects awaiting execution.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Ishita Jairath</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Ishita Jairath</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 29, 2026 at 07:35 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 29, 2026 at 07:35 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n